{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25600374",
      "title": "Finalizing the Fetching Logic",
      "sourceHash": "d82a6d7368812410a5d3e8a118ea2076aaac5cec50cae92043e873afdbfa6a23",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 3.71,
          "en": "As always in programming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.71,
          "end": 6.77,
          "en": "there will be multiple ways of fixing that issue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.77,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "we detected in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 10.94,
          "en": "where we automatically resent the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.94,
          "end": 13.121,
          "en": "when the application loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.121,
          "end": 15.68,
          "en": "One possible solution, could be to go to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.68,
          "end": 20.68,
          "en": "our cart-slice and here in that initial state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.034,
          "end": 26.12,
          "en": "we, for example, add a changed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.12,
          "end": 27.643,
          "en": "which is false, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 33.05,
          "en": "And we don't change this if we replaced a cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.05,
          "end": 36.11,
          "en": "but we do change it if we add or remove items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.11,
          "end": 37.87,
          "en": "to or from the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.87,
          "end": 40.713,
          "en": "Then we set state.changed to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.519,
          "end": 46.15,
          "en": "And removeItemFromcart and addItemToCart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.15,
          "end": 50.16,
          "en": "are only executed from our local application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.16,
          "end": 52.55,
          "en": "So, when we fetch data from Firebase,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.55,
          "end": 55.427,
          "en": "where we then execute replaceCart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.427,
          "end": 56.26,
          "en": "this will not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.26,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "It will stay false. Now, how can this help us?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 64.27,
          "en": "Well in App.js, where we have this effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.27,
          "end": 67.37,
          "en": "for sending CartData, we can also check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.37,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "if cart changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 72.31,
          "en": "So if our cart, which we're selecting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.31,
          "end": 75.63,
          "en": "if that changed property, is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.63,
          "end": 78.7,
          "en": "and only if it's true, we wanna dispatch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.7,
          "end": 79.9,
          "en": "and send the CartData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.9,
          "end": 82.73,
          "en": "If it's false, so if it hasn't changed locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.73,
          "end": 84.053,
          "en": "we don't wanna send it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.23,
          "end": 87.03,
          "en": "With this simple change implemented,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.03,
          "end": 89.63,
          "en": "if we reload, we're not sending this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.63,
          "end": 92.17699999999999,
          "en": "Only if I add something to the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.17699999999999,
          "end": 94.93,
          "en": "Now, as a side note, this changed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.93,
          "end": 97.15,
          "en": "is now all the part of Firebase,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 99.85,
          "en": "because we're sending the overall cart state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.85,
          "end": 102.37,
          "en": "as it's stored by Redux to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.37,
          "end": 104.69,
          "en": "If we would wanna avoid this, we could of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.69,
          "end": 106.9,
          "en": "go to the cart-actions and there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.9,
          "end": 109.6,
          "en": "where we send our cart data, instead of taking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.6,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "the whole cart, we could create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 113.91,
          "en": "a new objects, where we then just use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.91,
          "end": 116.57,
          "en": "items from cart items and just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.57,
          "end": 120.933,
          "en": "the totalQuantity from cart.totalQuantity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.17,
          "end": 124.91,
          "en": "So we would create a new object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.91,
          "end": 127.1,
          "en": "which does not contain changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.1,
          "end": 129.35,
          "en": "That's something we could do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129.35,
          "end": 133.943,
          "en": "And with that, it is removed, if we send something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.95,
          "end": 136.973,
          "en": "Now it's no longer part of Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.89,
          "end": 140.48,
          "en": "So now, that should be working as we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.48,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "Now we can add items to the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 145.97,
          "en": "change our cart, however we need to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.97,
          "end": 147.65,
          "en": "add more and less.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.65,
          "end": 150.418,
          "en": "And that is then synced to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.418,
          "end": 152.61,
          "en": "Though I see that the price here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.61,
          "end": 153.55,
          "en": "doesn't update correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.55,
          "end": 155,
          "en": "We should look into this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155,
          "end": 157.121,
          "en": "But that's now synced to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.121,
          "end": 159.5,
          "en": "And they offer this now works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.5,
          "end": 161.8,
          "en": "At least when it comes to the side effects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.8,
          "end": 165.21,
          "en": "and to HTTP requests, we are of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 167.69,
          "en": "also loading data correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.69,
          "end": 169.4,
          "en": "I just detected that we have a issue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.4,
          "end": 171.52,
          "en": "regarding the price, that does not update correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.52,
          "end": 174.96,
          "en": "if I reduce my cart quantity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 176.85,
          "en": "So let's quickly look into that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 176.85,
          "end": 180.57,
          "en": "in cart-slice and removeItemFromCart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.57,
          "end": 183.25,
          "en": "Yeah, for existing items, I am reducing the quantity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.25,
          "end": 185.18,
          "en": "but I'm not updating the price.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.18,
          "end": 186.621,
          "en": "We should of course be doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.621,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "I'll set totalPrice equal to existingItem.totalPrice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 194.26,
          "en": "not totalQuantity, thank you, totalPrice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.26,
          "end": 198.17000000000002,
          "en": "minus existingItem.price.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.17000000000002,
          "end": 201.62,
          "en": "To reduce the total price, by the price",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 201.62,
          "end": 203.3,
          "en": "of a single item, since we're removing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.3,
          "end": 204.7,
          "en": "a single item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 204.7,
          "end": 207.53,
          "en": "If we do that and I reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.53,
          "end": 210.94,
          "en": "and I clear my cart, to start from scratch again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.94,
          "end": 213.93,
          "en": "if you do that and I try to start editing again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 216.16,
          "en": "we get another error and that actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.16,
          "end": 219.22,
          "en": "is an expected error, which I wanted to dive in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 219.22,
          "end": 220.69,
          "en": "We're getting this error because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 220.69,
          "end": 223.52,
          "en": "I cleared my cart entirely and I reloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.52,
          "end": 227.02,
          "en": "and therefore I fetched my cart data from Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 227.02,
          "end": 229.66,
          "en": "Since I cleared the cart entirely though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 229.66,
          "end": 231.576,
          "en": "we see that on Firebase here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 231.576,
          "end": 235.17000000000002,
          "en": "we have no items key in the cart anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 235.17000000000002,
          "end": 238.04,
          "en": "So we fetched that data from Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 238.04,
          "end": 240.96,
          "en": "and we set our local carts to the fetched cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 240.96,
          "end": 244.27,
          "en": "And that means that items is now not an empty array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 244.27,
          "end": 246.37,
          "en": "but undefined and therefore trying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 246.37,
          "end": 249.79,
          "en": "to call find on undefined, fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 249.79,
          "end": 252.317,
          "en": "To solve this, we should go to cart-actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 252.317,
          "end": 254.843,
          "en": "and to the place where we fetch our cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 254.843,
          "end": 258.99,
          "en": "And then, when we replace our cart with cartData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 258.99,
          "end": 262.24,
          "en": "there indeed is a tiny transformation we should make.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 262.24,
          "end": 264.89,
          "en": "We should make sure, that the payload we pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 264.89,
          "end": 268.57,
          "en": "to replaceCart, is a object which always has",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 268.57,
          "end": 272.87,
          "en": "a items key, which is either cartsData.items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 272.87,
          "end": 274.83299999999997,
          "en": "or if that should be undefined and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 274.83299999999997,
          "end": 277.797,
          "en": "a falsy and empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 277.797,
          "end": 282.797,
          "en": "And total quantity is always cartData.totalQuantity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 283.63,
          "end": 287.008,
          "en": "because that still is part of Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 287.008,
          "end": 289.505,
          "en": "With that, we ensure that we never end up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 289.505,
          "end": 291.65999999999997,
          "en": "with items being undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.65999999999997,
          "end": 294.47,
          "en": "Instead, it will always be an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 294.47,
          "end": 297.315,
          "en": "With that, if we reload, we can add to the cart again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 297.315,
          "end": 300.94,
          "en": "and now we can also deduct items from the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 300.94,
          "end": 303.732,
          "en": "And now the price updates correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.732,
          "end": 305.27,
          "en": "Can reload again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.27,
          "end": 307.13,
          "en": "And this now all works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 307.13,
          "end": 309.59,
          "en": "And now we also implemented HTTP,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309.59,
          "end": 311.99,
          "en": "in side effects with Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 311.99,
          "end": 313.93,
          "en": "And you learned about different approaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 313.93,
          "end": 314.833,
          "en": "of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}